---
layout: base.njk
title: Our Projects | Commercial Construction Portfolio | Ridgeway Services
description: Browse 30+ years of commercial construction work — retail, restaurant, office & tenant improvement projects completed across the GTA & Southern Ontario.
---
<section class="section section-full section-hero-header interior" data-reveal-group>
  <div class="container-interior" data-reveal>
    <h1>Featured Projects</h1>
    <p>
      Explore a selection of our completed projects showcasing our expertise in commercial 
      construction, renovations, and tenant improvements. From retail spaces and restaurants 
      to offices and new developments, each project reflects our commitment to quality 
      craftsmanship, attention to detail, and delivering results that meet our clients' goals.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="projects-page section section-full" data-reveal-group>
  <div class="container-interior" data-reveal>
    <div class="filter-bar">
      <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all">All</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="residential">Residential</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="retail">Retail</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="restaurants">Restaurants</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="offices">Offices</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="daycare">Daycare</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="education">Education</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="commercial-design">Design</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="commercial-plaza">Plazas</button>
    </div>

    <div class="project-grid">
      {% for project in projects %}
        <a href="{{ project.url }}" class="project-tile" data-category="{{ project.category | lower | replace(' ', '-') }}">
          <div class="project-tile-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          {% if project.image %}
            <img src="{{ project.image }}" alt="{{ project.title }}" />
          {% endif %}
          <div class="project-tile-overlay">
            <span class="project-category">{{ project.category }}</span>
            <h3>{{ project.title }}</h3>
            <span class="view-project">View Project <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "contact.njk" %}
{% include "faq.njk" %}